---
description: General project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read the root AGENTS.md before making changes.
- Use JavaScript only; do not introduce TypeScript.
- Keep changes limited to the assigned task.
- Do not add dependencies without explaining why.
- Do not invent requirements; ask when a decision is necessary.
- Validate untrusted input.
- Never expose secrets or sensitive data.
- Update docs when API or database contracts change.
- Present a plan before broad or cross-module changes.
